{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIxL0NydWVsbGElMjAlMjgyMDIxJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Cruella","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hjS9mH8KvRiGHgjk6VUZH7OT0Ng.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6MKr3KgOLmzOP6MSuZERO41Lpkt.jpg","description":"In 1970s London amidst the punk rock revolution, a young grifter named Estella is determined to make a name for herself with her designs. She befriends a pair of young thieves who appreciate her appetite for mischief, and together they are able to build a life for themselves on the London streets. One day, Estella’s flair for fashion catches the eye of the Baroness von Hellman, a fashion legend who is devastatingly chic and terrifyingly haute. But their relationship sets in motion a course of events and revelations that will cause Estella to embrace her wicked side and become the raucous, fashionable and revenge-bent Cruella.","releaseInfo":"2021","genres":["Comedy","Crime","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"8.0","runtime":"134 min","cast":["Emma Stone","Emma Thompson","Joel Fry","Paul Walter Hauser","John McCrea","Emily Beecham","Mark Strong","Kayvan Novak"],"director":["Craig Gillespie"],"released":"2021-05-26T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Hello cruel world.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Emma Stone","character":"Estella / Cruella","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mstXxlDqhoK0s0molsNpskJ1wLH.jpg"},{"name":"Emma Thompson","character":"The Baroness","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zQ0hWHh3tzaOOziPbABQI8s9WCu.jpg"},{"name":"Joel Fry","character":"Jasper","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tk6RncU1WEvjpeU1hog9cFsjMRC.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Walter Hauser","character":"Horace","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hXjjbYg1Ah8mFf5ZcaakyXzDKMx.jpg"},{"name":"John McCrea","character":"Artie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xdyQaZq7CXMYk56dtArCrysQMuL.jpg"},{"name":"Emily Beecham","character":"Catherine / Maid","photo":"https://image.tmdb.or